  "description": "Create a cheerful throwback aesthetic with this vintage-inspired diagonal stripe seamless pattern in a lively palette of yellow, blue, green, and orange. The angled stripes bring movement and energy while maintaining a timeless retro feel, making the design easy to incorporate into both bold statement pieces and subtle background applications. The repeating format makes it suitable for a wide range of digital, printable, and commercial design projects.\n✨What’s Included:\n•15 seamless patterns\n•Format: JPEG\n•Size: 3600 × 3600 px\n•High-resolution digital files\n✨Perfect for:\n•Scrapbooking and journaling\n•Digital paper and stationery\n•Fabric and textile designs\n•Wrapping paper and packaging\n•Planner and scrapbook backgrounds\n•Canva and social media graphics\n•Invitations and party decorations\n•Branding and small business projects\n•Apparel and accessories\n•Retro-inspired crafts",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Create a cheerful throwback aesthetic with this vintage-inspired diagonal stripe seamless pattern in a lively palette of yellow, blue, green, and orange. The angled stripes bring movement and energy while maintaining a timeless retro feel, making the design easy to incorporate into both bold statement pieces and subtle background applications. The repeating format makes it suitable for a wide range of digital, printable, and commercial design projects.</p>\n<p>✨What’s Included:<br>\n•15 seamless patterns<br>\n•Format: JPEG<br>\n•Size: 3600 × 3600 px<br>\n•High-resolution digital files</p>\n<p>✨Perfect for:<br>\n•Scrapbooking and journaling<br>\n•Digital paper and stationery<br>\n•Fabric and textile designs<br>\n•Wrapping paper and packaging<br>\n•Planner and scrapbook backgrounds<br>\n•Canva and social media graphics<br>\n•Invitations and party decorations<br>\n•Branding and small business projects<br>\n•Apparel and accessories<br>\n•Retro-inspired crafts</p>",
